  "name": "Caramel Frappe",
  "subtitle": "A cold, creamy espresso drink with caramel",
  "description": "Blend espresso, milk, ice, caramel sauce, and optional vanilla into a smooth iced drink. Finish with optional whipped cream and extra caramel sauce.",
